                                     ;   inside the map HIGH region, behind
                                     ;   AMOVL_STAGE's 1280 B, exactly like the
                                     ;   other three. split_menu_ovl.py lifts it
                                     ;   out before check_xex.py ever sees it
; STAGE 2 -- the intermission is 2.1 KB and MENU_RUN is 1280, so the bulk of it
