;   Bonus ids 25..31, BN_STAT 9 -- give_bonus' third class, next to the counters
;   (1..15) and the bit sets (16..24). The state lives in the $0F00-$0F3F hole
;   the door arrays left when they moved under the ROM.
;   WHAT IS AND IS NOT MODELLED is in the powerups.asm header; the short version
;   is that the computer map and the light-amp visor are taken and do nothing
;   (no automap, and no light diminishing to amplify), and invulnerability gets
;   no inverse palette because update_flash already owns all four VBXE ones.
PW_INVIS    = $0F00                  ; u16 DOOM tics left -- partial invisibility
PW_IRON     = $0F02                  ; u16 -- the radiation suit
PW_INVUL    = $0F04                  ; u16 -- invulnerability
PW_FLAGS    = $0F06                  ; b0 backpack, b1 berserk (pw_strength):
                                     ;   neither is a countdown
bn_cap      = $0F07                  ; give_bonus/wp_give: the cap that applies
