                                     ;   it became LIGHTS_BASE below. 176 B of
                                     ;   headroom is left, and pack_map.py
                                     ;   asserts the real blob against it -- a
                                     ;   level set that outgrows this fails the
                                     ;   build, it cannot corrupt anything.
                                     ;   KEEP IN STEP with pack_textures.py
                                     ;   TEXIX_MAX and ram_map.py RESERVED.
